@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = REEMPLAZA_CON_SESSION_ACCESS_TOKEN_DE_NEON_AUTH

### Salud pública
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Perfil autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear plantilla; conserva la Idempotency-Key si se reintenta
POST {{baseUrl}}/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: template-create-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Semana de prueba"}

### Lista plantillas y toma el UUID y ETag para el resto de peticiones
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activar plantilla (If-Match: "0" cuando aún no exista selección)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/active-selection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "0"
Idempotency-Key: active-selection-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"templateId":"REEMPLAZA_UUID"}

### Consultar agenda
GET {{baseUrl}}/agenda?date=2026-11-12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar revisiones
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates/REEMPLAZA_UUID/revisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear un bloque. Reemplaza el UUID y usa el ETag actual de la plantilla.
POST {{baseUrl}}/templates/REEMPLAZA_UUID/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "1"
Idempotency-Key: block-create-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Revisar proyecto","description":"Bloque de prueba","tagName":"Trabajo","daysMask":127,"startMinute":540,"endMinute":600}

### Crear una tarea temporal. Usa una fecha de hoy o futura en la zona de la cuenta.
POST {{baseUrl}}/one-off-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: oneoff-create-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"date":"YYYY-MM-DD","title":"Llamar al equipo","description":"Prueba API","tagName":"Trabajo","startMinute":660,"endMinute":690}

### Consultar una fecha y copiar occurrenceKey de una ocurrencia semanal futura
GET {{baseUrl}}/agenda?date=YYYY-MM-DD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Completar una ocurrencia (repetir exactamente con la misma clave para probar idempotencia)
POST {{baseUrl}}/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: completion-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"date":"YYYY-MM-DD","occurrenceKey":"PEGA_OCCURRENCE_KEY","completed":true}

### Omitir una ocurrencia futura; usa If-Match: "0" para crear la excepción
POST {{baseUrl}}/occurrence-exceptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "0"
Idempotency-Key: exception-skip-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"date":"YYYY-MM-DD","occurrenceKey":"PEGA_OCCURRENCE_KEY","action":"SKIP"}

### Consultar historial de una ventana de hasta 31 días
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD&limit=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Neon Auth entrega el JWT al SDK; esta API no ofrece endpoints de contraseña.
